    "text": "Let<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp; If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;is a&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;identity matrix, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to :"
  },
